{"id":1438,"name":"Kanojo to Kanojo no Neko: Everything Flows","slug":"kanojo_to_kanojo_no_neko_everything_flows","synopsis":"For the longest time, it's just been the two of them. \"Kanojo\" and her cat Daru are inseparable, having grown up together. Now a junior in college, Tomoka—her roommate of a year and a half—moves out of their shared apartment, and in order to keep her living space, Kanojo must find a job. Day by day, Daru watches her continued efforts from a cat's-eye view, eagerly awaiting his owner's return. When she gets back, once again, it's just she and her cat.\n\n*Kanojo to Kanojo no Neko: Everything Flows* is a charming short series about the bond between a pet and his owner.\n","format":"TV_SHORT","season":"WINTER","year":2016,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:02","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 03:58:56","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":32491},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21577},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":11737},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":11874},{"site":"ANN","externalId":17980},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7678},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":2867,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/M6oBfzQIlLskNUX6n2rKpHaTsJ8cR6DRPJtMmruG.jpg"},{"id":2868,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/MGZfOwGGcy0nyNNASIRsF5qfrl1S19jTIPTSuZPm.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":41,"name":"LIDENFILMS","slug":"lidenfilms"},{"id":346,"name":"LIDENFILMS Kyoto Studio","slug":"lidenfilms_kyoto_studio"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":7136,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":7137,"title":"Garasu no Hitomi","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":8293,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":7379,"basename":"KanojoToKanojoNoNeko-OP1-BD1080.webm","filename":"KanojoToKanojoNoNeko-OP1-BD1080","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/KanojoToKanojoNoNeko-OP1-BD1080.w